      "title": "Greens leader denies knowledge of ‘secret dossier’ on how to handle Jordon Steele-John misconduct allegations",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/16/david-shoebridge-denies-secret-dossier-jordon-steel-john-misconduct-allegations-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>David Shoebridge says 47-page document not ‘made by, used by, or seen by’ his office as matter referred to parliamentary standards commission</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">new political email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Greens leader David Shoebridge has denied knowledge of the existence of an alleged crisis management document on how to deal with allegations against Jordon Steele-John being made public.</p><p>The Nine newspapers <a href=\"https://www.smh.com.au/politics/federal/how-to-kill-a-story-the-secret-dossier-the-greens-used-to-protect-steele-john-20261016-p60xbe.html\">reported on Friday afternoon</a> the existence of a “secret dossier”, first drafted in 2016, which contained misconduct allegations against the Western Australian Greens senator and how to suppress their media coverage.</p><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/aug/28/politics-really-newsletter-guardian-australia-free-best-daily-auspol-email-subscribe?CMP=copyembed\">Sign up for Guardian Australia’s Politics, really newsletter here</a></strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/16/david-shoebridge-denies-secret-dossier-jordon-steel-john-misconduct-allegations-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-16T08:55:19"
